{
  "language_code": "eng",
  "language_probability": 1,
  "text": "Acne clients rarely quit. Acne clients rarely quit because of one bad week. They quit because they felt alone between appointments. That's why step three of the Clear code protocol is nurture. You'll be setting expectations from the start with what the first weeks may look like and how that progress is rarely a straight line. You'll be checking in between appointments, so a wobble doesn't become a cancellation. And you'll be giving them the education that they can go back to at home, so they can understand why they're doing what they're doing. And also you'll be helping your clients to celebrate the small wins out loud. Plan, launch, and nurture, that is the Clear code protocol. Our doors open on Black Friday. To join the waitlist, the link is in our bio.",
